      "short": "Painted rural scene with two large hay stacks in a colorful field under a soft sky.",
      "long": "A horizontally oriented painting showing two large, rounded hay stacks positioned left and right in the foreground/midground. The ground is rendered with short, multicolored brushstrokes in greens, blues, pinks, and yellows. Behind the stacks, a line of trees and low hills appears in muted purples and greens, fading into a pale, hazy sky that transitions from warm yellow near the horizon to cool gray-blue above. The entire surface shows visible impasto texture and broken color application.",
